 "walkthrough": "https://tombraiders.net/stella/walks/TR8walk/15gateofdead.html",
 "note": "Chapter 5 as chapter select starts it: after 230_val_intro she sits on bike 7229 in l5_valgrind_tunnel. The autopilot's ride lines follow the tunnel's centre line (66 000 units, 10 200 down, found on the unit's collision) with the raw stick; the stick stays inside half while braking (brake + stick past half is the power slide, which spins the bike on the slope). [I] the brakes do not hold the bike on this slope in ours: with the brake held it still gains speed on the steeper stretches (4000 units/s at the hairpin), so the ride is fast; the original's ride is not traced. In the hall the hand brake (Jump) stops it, Interact gets off. Door 7400 (ar_ei_thor_slide_door, needs g_gauntletleft, which the chapter's gear has): Interact grips it inside its record's half cylinders (r 711) and turns her along its slide (yaw -90), Forward walks the leaf 663.7 to its limit in 2.9 s (thor_forward; [U] the original's stance and side: docs/GAMEPLAY.md Thor's gauntlets). Back on the bike, through the doorway: plane 7472 starts 235_val_shaft (7403; not shown here, its events and placement run), whose end stands her on foot and, because she rode in, the bike on marker 7404 beside her (7403 vt 58 / vt 60 [O bytecode], VehicleReal.ShaftCinematicStandsTheBikeOnItsMarker): she gets on it there.",
